        "extraction_method": "MANUAL",
        "document_version": "1.0",
        "content_hash": "84e1fb7565ce372c3ffe853670550b1e524224eb081a258f71b143abbcbe8bcc"
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E2",
      "text": "In 2021 the company agreed a joint venture with an international tank-storage group to operate terminals at strategic ports on both coasts. It already covered the chain from sourcing to distribution.",
      "source": {
        "source_id": "S2",
        "source_type": "DECLARATION",
        "title": "Investment manager's case-study note (partnership)",
        "collected_at": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z",
