      "text": "Carbon footprint is a sticking point for the industry. The company has installed floating roofs at its main facilities to cut vapour emissions, built an effluent treatment plant, and formed a committee to oversee this. An ESG rating agency upgraded its rating from BBB to A in February 2023.",
